{{ 'section-rich-text.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<div class="dr-policy-page page-width">
  <div class="dr-policy-hero">
    <div class="dr-policy-hero__badge">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13" rx="1"/><path d="M16 8h4l3 3v5h-7V8z"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/></svg>
      Shipping & Delivery
    </div>
    <h1 class="dr-policy-title">Shipping &amp; Delivery Policy</h1>
    <p class="dr-policy-subtitle">Fast, reliable nationwide delivery across Pakistan — because your skin deserves it on time.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="dr-policy-body rte">

    <div class="dr-policy-highlight-grid">
      <div class="dr-policy-highlight-card">
        <span class="dr-highlight-icon">📦</span>
        <strong>Nationwide Delivery</strong>
        <p>We ship to all cities and towns across Pakistan, from Karachi to Gilgit-Baltistan.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dr-policy-highlight-card">
        <span class="dr-highlight-icon">⏱️</span>
        <strong>3–5 Working Days</strong>
        <p>Standard delivery within 3 to 5 working days after order confirmation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dr-policy-highlight-card">
        <span class="dr-highlight-icon">💵</span>
        <strong>Cash on Delivery</strong>
        <p>Pay when your parcel arrives at your doorstep — no advance payment required.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>1. Order Processing</h2>
    <p>All orders placed on Dr. Romelia are processed within <strong>1–2 business days</strong> (Monday to Saturday, excluding public holidays). Once your order has been confirmed and dispatched, you will receive a WhatsApp notification with your tracking details.</p>
    <p>Please ensure your delivery address, contact number, and order details are accurate at the time of checkout. Dr. Romelia is not responsible for delays or non-deliveries due to incorrect information provided by the customer.</p>

    <h2>2. Standard Delivery Timeframe</h2>
    <p>We partner with trusted logistics providers to ensure your order reaches you safely and on time.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Major Cities</strong> (Karachi, Lahore, Islamabad, Rawalpindi, Faisalabad, Peshawar, Quetta): <strong>2–3 working days</strong></li>
      <li><strong>Other Cities &amp; Towns across Pakistan</strong>: <strong>3–5 working days</strong></li>
      <li><strong>Remote / Rural Areas</strong>: Up to <strong>6–7 working days</strong></li>
    </ul>
    <p><em>Note: Delivery timelines are estimates and may be subject to delays caused by weather conditions, peak seasons, or courier-specific issues beyond our control.</em></p>

    <h2>3. Cash on Delivery (COD)</h2>
    <p>We proudly offer <strong>Cash on Delivery (COD)</strong> nationwide across Pakistan. You pay only when your parcel is in your hands. No credit card, no advance bank transfer — just premium skincare, delivered to you with ease.</p>
    <p>COD is available for all orders within Pakistan. Please have the exact amount ready at the time of delivery.</p>

    <h2>4. Shipping Charges</h2>
    <p>Shipping charges, if applicable, are calculated at checkout based on your delivery location and order size. Free shipping promotions are applied automatically when eligibility criteria are met. Please refer to our active promotions for current free-shipping thresholds.</p>

    <h2>5. Order Tracking</h2>
    <p>Once your order is dispatched, our team will send your tracking information via <strong>WhatsApp</strong> to the mobile number provided at checkout. You may also contact our customer support team at <a href="mailto:dr.romeliaskincare@gmail.com">dr.romeliaskincare@gmail.com</a> or WhatsApp for any tracking enquiries.</p>

    <h2>6. Missed Delivery</h2>
    <p>If our courier attempts delivery and is unable to reach you, a re-delivery attempt will be made within 1–2 working days. After two unsuccessful attempts, the order may be returned to us. In such cases, please contact our support team to arrange a convenient re-dispatch.</p>

    <h2>7. Damaged in Transit</h2>
    <p>In the rare event that your order arrives damaged or tampered with, please <strong>do not accept the parcel</strong> and contact us immediately via WhatsApp or email with photographic evidence. We will arrange a replacement or refund in accordance with our Return &amp; Refund Policy.</p>

    <div class="dr-policy-contact-box">
      <h3>Need Help with Your Order?</h3>
      <p>Our customer care team is ready to assist you.</p>
      <div class="dr-policy-contact-links">
        <a href="mailto:dr.romeliaskincare@gmail.com" class="dr-policy-contact-btn">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
          dr.romeliaskincare@gmail.com
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

